re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I've called you here with the hopes of making you all more motivated and happier in your jobs, while also improving customer relations.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Michael</span>: This sounds good.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We've had a rough ride lately, and you might have felt underappreciated in the past but I'm determined to keep you employed here. So I am wondering how you feel about me hiring another server in order to allow each of you a few less hours a week or to help out.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: I could do with a few less hours. The last few weeks may have been the most difficult I've ever had since I began here.", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn11le01ob10re2img01.jpg", "time": "39500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Alexander</span>: I want more hours, not less.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Michael</span>: I'm fine with the hours I have.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I can hire her on without taking away any hours from you, but with the volume of customers and my goal to offer superior customer service, another server at peak hours will help us achieve that. She can act as a floater who can help you whenever you feel juiced. The last few weeks may have been the most difficult I've ever had since I began here.\nI don't think it was a true reflection of what actually transpired, but it may have been the impetus to bring me to this point.\nI'm eager to tell you the best news of all. First, you'll each get a free membership to a mindfulness meditation course which I hope you'll at least try out. And second, I worked out a plan with Bill that'll give you each two weeks' paid vacation every year going forward.", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn11le01ob10re2img02.jpg", "time": "103000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: Bill can't have approved that! What a joke!\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Rachel! As a matter of fact, he has, and two weeks' vacation was his idea.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Alexander</span>: This job just got a whole lot better.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Michael</span>: Thanks Vanessa. You rock!\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I want us to be a real team, and I want you to be happy about working here.", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}